					"content": "多虧你們，剛才已經有兩名患者醒來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾德娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111403,
					"content": "還有點睏…呼啊~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈特曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111404,
					"content": "太好了，這個辦法奏效！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111405,
					"content": "如果能把附近的<color=#00E1FFFF>隕石</color>都清理乾淨…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾德娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111406,
					"content": "大家就會從夢中醒來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111407,
					"content": "啊，真是個振奮人心的好消息。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧茲"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111408,
					"content": "哼哼，勞煩本皇女親自出馬，有這種結果也是應該的嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111409,
					"content": "那位醒來的先生，你在夢裡看到了什麼呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111410,
					"content": "只記得很冷，我在不停地走山路…是<color=#00E1FFFF>雪山</color>吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈特曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111411,
					"content": "走山路…？沒有目的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111412,
					"content": "呃，我也不知道呢，夢裡的我，似乎不完全受我控制。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈特曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111413,
					"content": "果然是詛咒，何等可悲的土地啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111414,
					"content": "（詛咒？真是如此嗎？）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111415,
					"content": "不管怎麼說，清理隕石的做法有效。看來，我們需要加大力度！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
