					"nextDialogs": [
						411111503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111503,
					"content": "呃，他…他已經睡了一整天，還沒有醒來的跡象。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111504,
						411111506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿德勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111504,
					"content": "是因為接觸了隕石嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111505,
					"content": "是的。睡得很沉，還有夢話。",
