					"nextDialogs": [
						411111508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿德勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111508,
					"content": "走不動了…真的，休息一會吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿德勒"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111509,
					"content": "他…他這是在幹什麼呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111510,
					"content": "黑暗之夢正如同銜著艾登果實的凶獸，它夤夜般深黑的雙目會使弱小之輩墜入深淵…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111511,
					"content": "意思是，夢中有什麼東西在引誘他？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111512,
					"content": "雖然還沒有證據，但皇女的直覺一向準確。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧茲"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111513,
					"content": "唔…還是再打聽一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111506,
					"content": "除了昏睡，還有其他症狀嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111507,
					"content": "暫時沒有。不過，他偶爾會說夢話。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "阿德勒"
				}
			]
		},
