					"nextDialogs": [
						411111602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾德娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111602,
					"content": "報上名來，夢魘的狂徒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111603,
					"content": "抱歉，不是說您。地上這位先生有說過什麼話嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧茲"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111604,
					"content": "似乎有說過要回去工作什麼的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾德娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111605,
					"content": "啊…酒，酒還…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "哈特曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111606,
					"content": "是與酒有關的工人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111607
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 411111607,
					"content": "他看起來睡得很沉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "奧茲"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111608,
					"content": "這不是一般的夢…是詛咒！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111609,
					"content": "能叫醒他嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111610,
					"content": "我試過。他短暫地醒來過一下，可沒多久又睡著了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾德娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111611,
					"content": "醒來後他有沒有透露什麼資訊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111612,
					"content": "他說夢見自己在山上，覺得很冷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111613
					],
					"speakerTitle": "艾德娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111613,
					"content": "山上？冷？嗯…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111614,
					"content": "莫非是雪山之惡魔的冷冽詛咒…泉水精靈守護的清泉小鎮，也終於成為被惡魔盯上的土地了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111615,
					"content": "真是棘手的事態，但無妨，只要由我斷罪…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111616,
					"content": "抱歉打擾各位，你們現在有空嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111617,
					"content": "是杜拉夫先生！出什麼事了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111618,
					"content": "呃，真是不好開口啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111619,
					"content": "我們這的<color=#00E1FFFF>後山</color>上也有<color=#00E1FFFF>隕石</color>，村裡那個<color=#00E1FFFF>艾倫</color>，吵著要去見識一下，一個人就衝出去了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111620,
					"content": "隕石的危險性你們也看到了，我擔心他出什麼意外，想請各位跟我走一趟，把他接回來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111621,
					"content": "都這麼危險了，他還去湊什麼熱鬧呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111622,
					"content": "就是！等這小子回來，一定要狠狠罵他一頓！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						411111623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杜拉夫"
				},
				{
					"id": 411111623,
					"content": "說得對，那我們現在就去找他吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4111117,
